; MIGRATION NOTE (windtrap 0.2): expect-test executables became
; (inline_tests) libraries -- dune builds and drives one runner per
; library, and corrections arrive via the ordinary promotion flow
; (dune promote <file>).

; Complete-screen visual goldens for the next TUI. Each feature executable
; drives the real Elm shell under Mosaic's headless Matrix backend and prints
; every terminal row; expectations are intentionally human-reviewable frames.

(library
 (name test_review)
 (modules test_review)
 (inline_tests)
 (libraries tui_harness windtrap)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_windtrap)))

